{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33363","headline":"九日卫使君筵上作 · 武瓘","name":"九日卫使君筵上作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佳晨登赏喜还乡，谢宇开筵晚兴长。\n满眼黄花初泛酒，隔烟红树欲迎霜。\n千家门户笙歌发，十里江山白鸟翔。\n共贺安人丰乐岁，幸陪珠履侍银章。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武瓘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}